                    seq_stabilise:          `Stabilise then build — protect competency and well-being first, redesign care, then scope AI on a recovering base`,
                    seq_aifirst:            `AI first — lead with the technology rollout, fit redesign and retention around it`,
                    seq_throughput:         `Throughput first — maximise occupancy now, deal with well-being and AI later`,
                    dash_balanced:          `Balanced — leading indicators (well-being, overtime, turnover-intent) AND lagging outcomes (safe-ratio, throughput, coverage)`,
                    dash_throughput:        `Throughput only — bed occupancy and wait times; that's what the CEO asked about`,
                    dash_financial:         `Financial only — overtime cost and agency spend; prove the budget held`,
                    pitch_honest:           `Honest — name the trade-off you accepted and what you chose NOT to do, with credible leading indicators`,
                    pitch_rosy:             `Rosy — promise full recovery in a quarter and no trade-offs; tell the CEO what they want to hear`,
                    pitch_defensive:        `Defensive — blame the agency cap and the resignations; ask for more money before committing`,

